 }
+
+# The Toshiba AC100 (ARM) gets the applications of the regular image that can
+# be built for it: nothing needing OpenGL or ffmpeg, and of the image
+# translators needing a library only those whose library is available for ARM
+# (PNG and JPEG, through HAIKU_EXTERNAL_LIBPNG_DIR and HAIKU_EXTERNAL_JPEG_DIR).
